--- build named after the file
built tool: 1 file, N bytes
default name ["x"]
[exit 0]
--- build when lube cannot find itself
built TMP/x: 1 file, N bytes
[exit 0]
--- debugger: Ctrl-C pauses a running program
Lube debugger: h lists the commands (Ctrl-C pauses the program)
   at <script> (TMP/spin.lube:N)
    N | (a line of the loop)
(lube) paused
   at <script> (TMP/spin.lube:N)
    N | (a line of the loop)
(lube) true
(lube) [exit 0]
